*  s188 seat4 REDUCTION of fz_segv_19 (row fuzz-segv-batch).  MECHANISM: M4 BLOB-ROAD FENCE/DEFER ADJACENCY (defer + ARBNO + FENCE)
*  Necessary ingredients, each measured by ablation: stored-pattern road + defer + ARBNO + FENCE. Inlining the defer is GREEN; dropping the ARBNO is GREEN; dropping the FENCE is GREEN; the capture and the SECOND (nested) FENCE are NOT ingredients.
          G0            =  POS(0)
          P             =  *G0 ARBNO(POS(2)) FENCE(NOTANY('ab'))
          'ab' POS(0) *P RPOS(0)                          :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match'                      :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
